text:
chloe: kicking off the release notes draft for the docs push (0.10.1). Main asks: finalize bullets, confirm SDK snippet parity, and list known issues. I'll open PR shortly.

rick: I'll run a fast linkcheck and send any redirect PRs. Spotted a couple of renamed anchors in /guides/serving that need redirect entries.

priya: Noted. Also flagging that several examples still use old streaming calls. We should standardize to `client.responses.stream()` or the new non-stream API depending on the page. I'll compile a file list.

chloe: Good catch. Let's prefer the non-stream examples in relnotes and add a short note about streaming-specific caveats in Known Issues.

devon: Known Issue candidate: embeddings streaming + long chunked inputs -> intermittent auth errors in e2e tests. Workaround: lower batch_size to 1 and enable prefix_cache. I'll paste the repro in the PR comments with EVAL-2024-10-05.

priya: Also, i18n snag: fr/ja translations have placeholder order differences that break code rendering. I filed INTL-902 and pinged the translators. We should freeze merges until translations confirm.

chloe: Draft JS snippet for relnotes (new API):
```javascript
const client = new RedwoodClient({ apiKey: process.env.RW_KEY });
try {
  const r = await client.responses.create({
    model: "redwood-kestrel-1",
    input: "What's new in this release?",
  });
  console.log(r.output_text);
} catch (e) {
  console.error('Request failed', e);
}
```

rick: Style nit: docs prefer double quotes and short error examples. I'll clean that when I touch the examples. Also opening PR for redirect fixes: https://github.com/redwood-inference/docs/pull/4955

intl-bot: intl-checker found 3 files missing normalized placeholders: /docs/quickstart, /docs/guides/embed-stream. Tickets: INTL-902, INTL-903

chloe: Timeline: localization cutoff 2024-09-30 23:59 UTC, publish target 2024-10-06 16:00 PT. Please add final snippets to the relnotes PR description so translators can preview.

priya: I'll batch snippet parity + tiny linkfixes into the relnotes PR to reduce noise. Ping me for wording.

devon: Merged redirect PR after CI green. Added the embeddings repro to the relnotes PR comment.

chloe: Thanks. Once snippets are standardized and intl confirms, I'll do a final pass and ship the relnotes. :ship:
